[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573556867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101185#issuecomment-2573556867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101185","id":2573556867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZVyD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T17:18:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T17:18:02Z","body":"There's no duplication, you're binding it twice, use *either* `add_virtual_method` *or* `bind_method`, not both","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573556867/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573672021","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101185#issuecomment-2573672021","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101185","id":2573672021,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZx5V","user":{"login":"Migzus","id":48204107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MjA0MTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48204107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus","html_url":"https://github.com/Migzus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Migzus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T18:26:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T18:39:20Z","body":"I must be daydreaming. I swear that it was inconsistent between the linux version and windows versions.\n(I just tested it again.)\nThat on linux it was defined once, and on windows it was defined twice.\nBut I have a feeling I may know what happened here. Probably never restarted the editor when I updated the code, so the auto generated documentation still displayed the old library.\nRegardless, I was already aware that I used both `add_virtual_method` and `bind_method` at the same time with the same name.\nBut because of that confusion I thought this was a bug, and assumed the linux version was the correct way to handle virtual methods.\n\nThis issue can be marked as resolved.\n\n\nThough, I guess my only question now is... How would I make this virtual function return a value that I desire?\nBecause this would return 0.\nBut what if I would like to return -1, or any other number for that matter?\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573672021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573713738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101185#issuecomment-2573713738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101185","id":2573713738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZZ8FK","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T18:52:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T18:52:18Z","body":"When binding it in the extension it should be called, it shouldn't be defined, you should use some other method that calls it instead, see the engine classes for reference","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2573713738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619616379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101185#issuecomment-2619616379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101185","id":2619616379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cJCx7","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T17:18:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T17:18:43Z","body":"> How would I make this virtual function return a value that I desire?\n\nVirtual methods in godot-cpp (as well as in Godot itself) are created via the `GDVIRTUAL*()` and `GDVIRTUAL_CALL()` macros.\n\nIn your case, you'd do something like:\n\n```\nclass Bar : public Object {\nGDCLASS(Bar, Object)\n\nprotected:\n  static void _bind_methods();\n\npublic:\n\n  GDVIRTUAL0R(int, _foo);\n\n  int foo();\n}\n```\n\nAnd then:\n\n```\nvoid Bar::_bind_methods() {\n  ClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"foo\"), &Bar::foo);\n\n  GDVIRTUAL_BIND(_foo);\n}\n\nint Bar::foo() {\n  int ret = -1;\n  GDVIRTUAL_CALL(_foo, ret);\n  return ret;\n}\n```\n\nThen in GDScript, you can override the `_foo` virtual method, which will be called when you run the (non-virtual) `foo()` method.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619616379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]